OL,3,A'Nothing diminishes gravity' of Henry
OL,4,ANowak's death, appeal court reviewing
OL,5,Akiller's sentence hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FVickrum Digwa stabbed 18-year-old
OL,8,Fstudent Henry Nowak to death in
OL,9,FSouthampton in December 2025
OL,11,FHe was found guilty of murder and
OL,12,Fjailed for life with a minimum term of
OL,13,F21 years
OL,15,FThe case gained international attention
OL,16,Fafter it emerged Digwa falsely claimed
OL,17,Fhe was the victim of a racist attack,
OL,18,Fleading to Nowak being handcuffed as he
OL,19,Flay dying
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
